# Excluded from deploy: GenAi metadata uses org-specific schema (versionIdentifier, etc.)
# Configure these in the org via Setup / Prompt Builder / Agent Builder if needed.
force-app/main/default/genAiPromptTemplates/
force-app/main/default/genAiFunctions/

# Custom Metadata RECORDS are org-specific (Claude Slack user id, auto-analyze flags,
# named credential names, project labels, AI model, etc.). Deploying them overwrites
# Legend/client sandbox configuration on every push. Keep type/field defs in objects/;
# configure Default records once per org in Setup.
force-app/main/default/customMetadata/

# Credential files are safe to commit — secrets are replaced with REPLACE_ME placeholders.
# After deploying to a new org, update the actual values in Setup:
#   - Slack_Webhook NC → paste the Slack incoming webhook URL
#   - LLM_Provider_API_Key External Credential → paste the AI API key

**/jsconfig.json
**/.eslintrc.json
